                "uzbek": "Ko'p qirrali yondashuv - muammoni hal qilishning ko'p turli jihatlari yoki echimlarini o'z ichiga olgan usuli.",
                "example": "Solving climate change requires a multi-faceted approach involving governments, businesses, and individuals.",
