                "definition": "Systems used to monitor and track the spread of diseases or other health-related issues.",
                "uzbek": "Kuzatuv tizimlari - kasalliklar yoki sog'liq bilan bog'liq boshqa muammolarning tarqalishini kuzatish va kuzatish uchun ishlatiladigan tizimlar.",
